{"id":1291,"date":"2026-08-22T08:44:24","date_gmt":"2026-08-22T08:44:24","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1291"},"modified":"2026-08-22T09:22:31","modified_gmt":"2026-08-22T09:22:31","slug":"business-information","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/marketing\/business-information\/","title":{"rendered":"Business Information"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Business Information<\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">The Business Information feature lets you store your core business details once and then instantly generate pre-formatted, auto-populated templates across your documents &#8211; no retyping required.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Setting Up Your Business Information<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1294\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-094316.png\" alt=\"Setting Up Your Business Information\" width=\"213\" height=\"289\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-094316.png 479w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-094316-221x300.png 221w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 213px) 100vw, 213px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">To set up your Business Information:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Go to <strong>Insert &gt; Business Information<\/strong> (or <strong>Insert &gt; Business Card \/ Letterhead<\/strong>).<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">The Business Information dialog opens.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Fill in the fields: <strong>Name<\/strong>, <strong>Job Title<\/strong>, <strong>Organisation<\/strong>, <strong>Address<\/strong>, <strong>Contact Info<\/strong>, <strong>Tagline<\/strong>, and <strong>Logo URL<\/strong>.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Click <strong>Save<\/strong>. Your details are stored securely in your browser&#8217;s LocalStorage and will be available every time you open Open Publisher.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Using Your Business Information<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1298\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/BuisnessInfomation.webp\" alt=\"Business Information\" width=\"127\" height=\"133\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/BuisnessInfomation.webp 436w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/BuisnessInfomation-287x300.webp 287w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 127px) 100vw, 127px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">From the <strong>Insert<\/strong> ribbon, open the <strong>Business Information<\/strong> dropdown and choose from three ready-made templates, each auto-populated with your stored details:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Letterhead &#8211;<\/strong> A formatted header block for professional correspondence, auto-populated with your name, company, and contact details.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Business Card &#8211;<\/strong> A compact, formatted business card layout pre-filled with all your stored information and logo.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Signature &#8211;<\/strong> A compact email or document signature block.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p class=\"western\">Each template is inserted as a fully editable group on the canvas, positioned and sized for immediate use.<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-1296 size-full\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-094544.png\" alt=\"Using Your Business Information\" width=\"1684\" height=\"925\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-094544.png 1684w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-094544-300x165.png 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-094544-1024x562.png 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-094544-768x422.png 768w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-094544-1536x844.png 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1684px) 100vw, 1684px\" \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Business Information The Business Information feature lets you store your core business details once and then instantly generate pre-formatted, auto-populated templates across your documents &#8211; no retyping required. Setting Up Your Business Information To set up your Business Information: Go to Insert &gt; Business Information (or Insert &gt; Business Card \/ Letterhead). The Business Information [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1304,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[19],"class_list":["post-1291","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-marketing"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1291","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledge